BasicSwap  (https://github.com/tecnovert/basicswap)
The MIT License (MIT) — Copyright (c) 2019-2024 tecnovert

PwndaWallet embeds a MODIFIED copy of BasicSwap as its atomic-swap engine. The
modifications are kept as a numbered, append-only patch series under
`upstream/patches/`, applied to a pinned upstream tag rather than merged into a
fork, so exactly what was changed and why is readable in isolation. The
distribution is identified at runtime as `pwnda-grove <upstream version>+p<N>`.

Per the MIT license, the upstream copyright notice and permission notice are
retained in `upstream/basicswap/LICENSE` (fetched with the pinned source) and
reproduced with any distribution. Modified files carry `PWNDA-PATCH-<n>`
markers naming the change.

