Bundled third-party binaries

The installer embeds, or downloads on demand, unmodified upstream binaries from
the projects below. Each is pinned by version and verified by SHA256 (and, where
the publisher signs releases, by GPG) before use. None is modified; each remains
under its own license.

  Mining          xmrig, lolMiner, SRBMiner-MULTI
  Coin daemons    Particl, Bitcoin, Litecoin, Bitcoin Cash Node, Monero, Zephyr
  Wallet RPC      monero-wallet-rpc, zephyr-wallet-rpc
  Runtime         CPython (python-build-standalone)

The full inventory — every binary, its source URL, its pin, and whether it is
embedded or fetched at runtime — is maintained in the project documentation
under `shipped-binary-inventory`.

